  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 3.12,
      "e": 5.56,
      "text": "(upbeat music)"
    },
    {
      "s": 5.56,
      "e": 7.81,
      "text": "- We were dispatched as a cardiac arrest,"
    },
    {
      "s": 7.81,
      "e": 10.09,
      "text": "and usually when that happens, usually"
    },
    {
      "s": 10.09,
      "e": 12.4,
      "text": "for most of our calls, fire gets here before we do."
    },
    {
      "s": 12.4,
      "e": 16.15,
      "text": "So when we got here we saw the fire truck outside."
    },
    {
      "s": 16.15,
      "e": 17.45,
      "text": "So we just grabbed all of our equipment"
    },
    {
      "s": 17.45,
      "e": 21.36,
      "text": "and then came inside, we saw fire doing chest compressions"
    },
    {
      "s": 21.36,
      "e": 23.53,
      "text": "and we saw the AED pads live so,"
    },
    {
      "s": 23.53,
      "e": 25.09,
      "text": "we knew it was the real deal,"
    },
    {
      "s": 25.09,
      "e": 26.86,
      "text": "so we just jumped in and assisted."
    },
    {
      "s": 26.86,
      "e": 29.7,
      "text": "I can't believe how smooth that call went"
    },
    {
      "s": 29.7,
      "e": 31.29,
      "text": "because that's a pretty serious call"
    },
    {
      "s": 31.29,
      "e": 34.39,
      "text": "and there's so many hands on and with so many people around"
    },
    {
      "s": 34.39,
      "e": 37.44,
      "text": "that it was just such a very smooth rotation."
    },
    {
      "s": 37.44,
      "e": 39.67,
      "text": "And everybody worked so well together."
    },
    {
      "s": 39.67,
      "e": 43.57,
      "text": "- So to be front on the first day to this call,"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.57,
      "e": 45.92,
      "text": "it was definitely nerve wracking because"
    },
    {
      "s": 45.92,
      "e": 48.69,
      "text": "you go into into the mindset that you're gonna take control"
    },
    {
      "s": 48.69,
      "e": 50.73,
      "text": "and that you're going to be able to"
    },
    {
      "s": 50.73,
      "e": 52.92,
      "text": "talk to the patient and see what's going on"
    },
    {
      "s": 52.92,
      "e": 54.22,
      "text": "and kinda get their side of the story,"
    },
    {
      "s": 54.22,
      "e": 58.04,
      "text": "but when you walk in and he's not responsive"
    },
    {
      "s": 58.04,
      "e": 59.82,
      "text": "and there's already people pumping on his chest,"
    },
    {
      "s": 59.82,
      "e": 62.99,
      "text": "performing CPR, it kinda shifts what"
    },
    {
      "s": 62.99,
      "e": 65.23,
      "text": "you're supposed to do at that point in time."
    },
    {
      "s": 65.23,
      "e": 67.03,
      "text": "But the fact that we were able to save him"
    },
    {
      "s": 67.03,
      "e": 69.07,
      "text": "and to be able to be part of that was awesome."
    },
    {
      "s": 69.07,
      "e": 70.46,
      "text": "(clapping)"
    },
    {
      "s": 70.46,
      "e": 73.29,
      "text": "(inspiring music)"
    }
